# Residual, by shape: the pin attests ONE executable, the
# aarch64-apple-darwin payload at the manifest path. Every other executable
# is outside the sha: the sibling executables the platform tarball carries
# beside it, the payloads of the other npm platforms, and the launcher of
# the main package (bin/codex.js). Same posture as every earlier generation,
# not a regression of this pack.
# Current compatibility floor (Onda6B): stable Codex CLI releases at or above
# 0.128.0 are compatible version evidence. This unbounded range is not a
